#!/usr/bin/env bb
;; The generation-time refusals of emon's own forms (emit-ascii, defenum, defctx, fd).
;;     bb lang-test
;; The code they refuse to generate cannot be compiled to compare, so this is
;; a Clojure test beside the vocabulary; `bb check` runs it first.
(require '[babashka.classpath :as cp])
(cp/add-classpath "kin/src")
(load-file "kin/src/emon/lang_test.clj")
;; REACHED ONLY IF EVERY TEST PASSED (the file exits 1 otherwise): say so, so
;; `bb gates` can see a score. clojure.test's own summary is not one (P0.7).
(println "  ok   lang-test: emit-ascii, defenum, defctx and fd refusals hold")
